[{"title":"","label":"第 1 则","author":"","text":"读经宜冬，其神专也；读史宜夏，其时久也；读诸子宜秋，其致别也；读诸集宜春，其机物也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 1 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[0]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 2 则","author":"","text":"经传宜独坐读，史鉴宜与友共读。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 2 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[1]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 3 则","author":"","text":"无善无恶是圣人(如“帝力何有于我”、“杀之而不怨，利之而不庸”、“以直报怨，以德报德”、“一介不与，一介不取”之类)，善多恶少是贤者(如颜子“不贰过，有不善未尝不知”、子路“人告有过则喜”之类)，善少恶多是庸人，有恶无善是小人(其偶为善处，亦必有所为)，有善无恶是仙佛(其所谓善，亦非吾儒之所谓善也)。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 3 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[2]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 4 则","author":"","text":"天下有一人知己，可以不恨。不独人也，物亦有之。如菊以渊明为知己，梅以和靖为知己，竹以子猷为知己，莲以濂溪为知己，桃以避秦人为知己，杏以董奉为知己，石以米颠为知己，荔枝以太真为知己，茶以卢仝、陆羽为知己，香草以灵均为知己，莼鲈以季鹰为知己，蕉以怀素为知己，瓜以邵平为知己，鸡以处宗为知己，鹅以右军为知己，鼓以祢衡为知己，琵琶以明妃为知己。一与之订，千秋不移。若松之于秦始，鹤之于卫懿，正所谓不可与作缘者也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 4 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[3]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 5 则","author":"","text":"为月忧云，为书忧蠹，为花忧风雨，为才子、佳人忧命薄，真是菩萨心肠。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 5 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[4]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 6 则","author":"","text":"花不可以无蝶，山不可以无泉，石不可以无苔，水不可以无藻，乔木不可以无藤萝，人不可以无癖。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 6 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[5]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 7 则","author":"","text":"春听鸟声，夏听蝉声，秋听虫声，冬听雪声，白昼听棋声，月下听箫声，山中听松风声，水际听欺乃声，方不虚生此世耳。若恶少斥辱，悍妻诟谇，真不若耳聋也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 7 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[6]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 8 则","author":"","text":"上元须酌豪友，端午须酌丽友，七夕须酌韵友，中秋须酌淡友，重九须酌逸友。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 8 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[7]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 9 则","author":"","text":"鳞虫中金鱼，羽虫中紫燕，可云物类神仙。正如东方曼倩避世金马门，人不得而害之。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 9 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[8]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 10 则","author":"","text":"入世须学东方曼倩，出世须学佛印了元。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 10 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[9]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 11 则","author":"","text":"赏花宜对佳人，醉月宜对韵人，映雪宜对高人。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 11 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[10]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 12 则","author":"","text":"对渊博友，如读异书；对风雅友，如读名人诗文；对谨饬友，如读圣贤经传；对滑稽友，如阅传奇小说。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 12 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[11]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 13 则","author":"","text":"楷书须如文人，草书须如名将，行书介乎二者之间，如羊叔子缓带轻裘，正是佳处。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 13 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[12]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 14 则","author":"","text":"人须求可入诗，物须求可入画。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 14 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[13]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 15 则","author":"","text":"少年人须有老成之识见，老成人须有少年之襟怀。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 15 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[14]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 16 则","author":"","text":"春者，天之本怀；秋者，天之别调。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 16 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[15]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 17 则","author":"","text":"昔人云：若无花月美人，不愿生此世界。予益一语云：若无翰墨棋酒，不必定作人身。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 17 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[16]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 18 则","author":"","text":"愿在木而为樗(不才，终其天年)，愿在草而为蓍(前知)，愿在鸟而为鸥(忘机)，愿在兽而为廌(触邪)，愿在虫而为蝶(花间栩栩)，愿在鱼而为鲲(逍遥游)。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 18 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[17]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 19 则","author":"","text":"黄九烟先生云：“古今人必有其偶双，千古而无偶者，其惟盘古乎！”予谓：“盘古亦未尝无偶，但我辈不及见耳。其人为谁？即此劫尽时，最后一人是也。”","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 19 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[18]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 20 则","author":"","text":" 古人以冬为三余，予谓当以夏为三余：晨起者，夜之余；夜坐者，昼之余；午睡者，应酬人事之余。古人诗云“我爱夏日长”，洵不诬也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 20 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[19]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 21 则","author":"","text":"庄周梦为蝴蝶，庄周之幸也；蝴蝶梦为庄周，蝴蝶之不幸也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 21 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[20]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 22 则","author":"","text":"艺花可以邀蝶，累石可以邀云，栽松可以邀风，贮水可以邀萍，筑台可以邀月，种蕉可以邀雨，植柳可以邀蝉。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 22 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[21]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 23 则","author":"","text":" 景有言之极幽而实萧索者，烟雨也；境有言之极雅而实难堪者，贫病也；声有言之极韵而实粗鄙者，卖花声也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 23 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[22]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 24 则","author":"","text":" 才子而富贵，定从福、慧双修得来。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 24 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[23]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 25 则","author":"","text":"新月恨其易沉，缺月恨其迟上。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 25 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[24]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 26 则","author":"","text":"躬耕吾所不能，学灌园而已矣；樵薪吾所不能，学薙草而已矣。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 26 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[25]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 27 则","author":"","text":"一恨书囊易蛀，二恨夏夜有蚊，三恨月台易漏，四恨菊叶多焦，五恨松多大蚁，六恨竹多落叶，七恨桂荷易谢，八恨薜萝藏虺，九恨架花生刺，十恨河豚多毒。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 27 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[26]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 28 则","author":"","text":"楼上看山，城头看雪，灯前看月，舟中看霞，月下看美人，另是一番情境。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 28 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[27]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 29 则","author":"","text":" 山之光，水之声，月之色，花之香，文人之韵致，美人之姿态，皆无可名状，无可执著，真足以摄召魂梦，颠倒情思。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 29 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[28]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 30 则","author":"","text":"假使梦能自主，虽千里无难命驾，可不羡长房之缩地；死者可以晤对，可不需少君之招魂；五岳可以卧游，可不俟婚嫁之尽毕。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 30 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[29]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 31 则","author":"","text":" 昭君以和亲而显，刘蕡以下第而传。可谓之不幸，不可谓之缺陷。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 31 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[30]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 32 则","author":"","text":" 以爱花之心爱美人，则领略自饶别趣；以爱美人之心爱花，则护惜倍有深情。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 32 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[31]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 33 则","author":"","text":"美人之胜于花者，解语也；花之胜于美人者，生香也。二者不可得兼，舍生香而取解语者也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 33 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[32]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 34 则","author":"","text":"窗内人于窗纸上作字，吾于窗外观之，极佳。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 34 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[33]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 35 则","author":"","text":"少年读书，如隙中窥月；中年读书，如庭中望月；老年读书，如台上玩月。皆以阅历之浅深为所得之浅深耳。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 35 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[34]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 36 则","author":"","text":"吾欲致书雨师：春雨宜始于上元节后 (观灯已毕)，至清明十日前之内(雨止桃开)，及谷雨节中；夏雨宜于每月上弦之前，及下弦之后(免碍于月)；秋雨宜于孟秋、季秋之上、下二旬(八月为玩月胜境)；至若三冬，正可不必雨也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 36 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[35]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 37 则","author":"","text":"为浊富，不若为清贫；以忧生，不若以乐死。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 37 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[36]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 38 则","author":"","text":"天下唯鬼最富，生前囊无一文，死后每饶楮镪；天下唯鬼最尊，生前或受欺凌，死后必多跪拜。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 38 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[37]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 39 则","author":"","text":"蝶为才子之化身，花乃美人之别号。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 39 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[38]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 40 则","author":"","text":"因雪想高士，因花想美人，因酒想侠客，因月想好友，因山水想得意诗文。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 40 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[39]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 41 则","author":"","text":"闻鹅声，如在白门；闻橹声，如在三吴；闻滩声，如在浙江；闻羸马项下铃铎声，如在长安道上。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 41 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[40]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 42 则","author":"","text":"一岁诸节，以上元为第一，中秋次之，五日、九日又次之。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 42 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[41]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 43 则","author":"","text":"雨之为物，能令昼短，能令夜长。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 43 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[42]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 44 则","author":"","text":"古之不传于今者，啸也，剑术也，弹棋也，打球也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 44 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[43]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 45 则","author":"","text":"诗僧时复有之，若道士之能诗者，不啻空谷足音，何也？","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 45 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[44]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 46 则","author":"","text":"当为花中之萱草，毋为鸟中之杜鹃。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 46 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[45]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 47 则","author":"","text":" 物之稚者，皆不可厌，惟驴独否。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 47 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[46]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 48 则","author":"","text":"女子自十四五岁至二十四五岁，此十年中，无论燕、秦、吴、越，其音大都娇媚动人；一睹其貌，则美恶判然矣。“耳闻不如目见”，于此益信。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 48 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[47]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 49 则","author":"","text":"寻乐境，乃学仙；避苦趣，乃学佛。佛家所谓“极乐世界”者，盖谓众苦之所不到也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 49 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[48]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 50 则","author":"","text":"富贵而劳悴，不若安闲之贫贱；贫贱而骄傲，不若谦恭之富贵。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 50 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[49]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 51 则","author":"","text":"目不能自见，鼻不能自嗅，舌不能自舐，手不能自握，惟耳能自闻其声。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 51 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[50]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 52 则","author":"","text":"凡声皆宜远听，惟听琴则远近皆宜。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 52 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[51]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 53 则","author":"","text":"目不能识字，其闷尤过于盲；手不能执管，其苦更甚于哑。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 53 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[52]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 54 则","author":"","text":"并头联句，交颈论文，宫中应制，历使属国，皆极人间乐事。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 54 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[53]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 55 则","author":"","text":"《水浒传》武松诘蒋门神云：“为何不姓李？”此语殊妙。盖姓实有佳有劣，如华、如柳、如云、如苏、如乔，皆极风韵；若夫毛也、赖也、焦也、牛也，则皆尘于目而棘于耳者也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 55 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[54]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 56 则","author":"","text":"花之宜于目而复宜于鼻者，梅也，菊也，兰也，水仙也，珠兰也，莲也；止宜于鼻者，橼也，桂也，瑞香也，栀子也，茉莉也，木香也，玫瑰也，腊梅也。余则皆宜于目者也。花与叶俱可观者，秋海棠为最，荷次之，海棠、酴(tu)醾 (mi）、虞美人、水仙又次之；叶胜于花者，止雁来红、美人蕉而已；花与叶俱不足观者，紫薇也，辛夷也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 56 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[55]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 57 则","author":"","text":"高语山林者，辄不喜谈市朝事。审若此，则当并废《史》、《汉》诸书而不读矣。盖诸书所载者，皆古之市朝也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 57 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[56]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 58 则","author":"","text":"云之为物，或崔巍如山，或潋滟如水，或如人，或如兽，或如鸟毳，或如鱼鳞；故天下万物皆可画，惟云不能画。世所画云，亦强名耳。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 58 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[57]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 59 则","author":"","text":"值太平世，生湖山郡；官长廉静，家道优裕；娶妇贤淑，生子聪慧。人生如此，可云全福。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 59 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[58]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 60 则","author":"","text":"天下器玩之类，其制日工，其价日贱，毋惑乎民之贫也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 60 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[59]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 61 则","author":"","text":"养花胆瓶，其式之高低大小，须与花相称；而色之浅深浓淡，又须与花相反。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 61 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[60]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 62 则","author":"","text":"春雨如恩诏，夏雨如赦书，秋雨如挽歌。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 62 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[61]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 63 则","author":"","text":"十岁为神童，二十、三十为才子，四十、五十为名臣，六十为神仙，可谓全人矣。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 63 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[62]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 64 则","author":"","text":" 武人不苟战，是为武中之文；文人不迂腐，是为文中之武。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 64 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[63]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}}]